      description: "Denosumab is a monoclonal antibody that neutralizes RANK ligand, the signal osteoblast-lineage cells use to form, activate and sustain osteoclasts. Bone resorption falls rapidly without renal clearance, but advanced CKD greatly magnifies hypocalcemia because CKD-mineral and bone disorder limits the body's ability to restore extracellular calcium. Effect reverses quickly when a dose is missed or stopped, creating rebound multiple-vertebral-fracture risk.",
